    {
      "id": "t_logic",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 160,
      "y": 540,
      "width": 640,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "Chain Decision Engine\n\n1. Depth check — loops used vs maxDepth (hard cap: 3 loops = 6 steps)\n2. Mode check:\n   • Deterministic → evaluateConditions(toolsMustInclude/Exclude)\n   • LLM Judge → judgeChainContinuation() via structured JSON output\n3. If continue → POST /run (Agent B) + setSession(chainDepth+1)",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "r_logic",
      "originalText": "Chain Decision Engine\n\n1. Depth check — loops used vs maxDepth (hard cap: 3 loops = 6 steps)\n2. Mode check:\n   • Deterministic → evaluateConditions(toolsMustInclude/Exclude)\n   • LLM Judge → judgeChainContinuation() via structured JSON output\n3. If continue → POST /run (Agent B) + setSession(chainDepth+1)",
      "strokeColor": "#e8590c",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
